# Production build config for the Unified Firewall site.
#
# These are the project's PUBLIC values and are safe to commit and ship in the
# client bundle: the anon key is protected by Row-Level Security, not by
# secrecy (the licensing tables allow no anonymous access at all; waitlist/leads
# are insert-only). This is standard Supabase practice — the anon key is meant
# to live in the browser.
#
# Override for a different project by setting these in Vercel's Environment
# Variables (they take precedence) or a local, gitignored .env.local.
